    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Department of Ophthalmology and Visual Sciences (DOVS) brought together leading experts and researchers for its Annual Research Conference held on October 9, 2025. The event highlighted innovative studies and global collaborations aimed at improving eye health and advancing the frontiers of vision science.",
